WEBVTT

NOTE
Ifrit - Hellfire. Fire demon summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~22 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Ifrit. Hellfire.

00:02.500 --> 00:07.000
A blazing meteor streaks down and slams into the field, throwing up a wall of fire.

00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
Ifrit rises from the flames — a horned, red-skinned beast wreathed in fire, roaring.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
He hurls his fists upward and conjures a vast ball of molten rock above him.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.000
Ifrit slams the meteor down on the enemies in a roaring inferno.

00:20.000 --> 00:23.000
The flames collapse; Ifrit is gone.
